  "description": "Delibera — Thoughtful AI Decisions. A framework for collective decision making through structured AI deliberation. Supports multi-model councils with RAG (Qdrant, PgVector), debate strategies, Knowledge Keeper, Chairman roles, dependency injection, context compression, AutoChunking (progressive disclosure for large documents), Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience (Polly v8 retry pipelines), IHttpClientFactory wiring, response-language enforcement, and parallel Operator requests.",
